From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: N0zoM1z0 <161784452+N0zoM1z0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:09:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Define the HUD TU's data and total_bombs_used in C++

The HUD's score variables precede its gaiji strings, and the shot level
table sits in the literal pool as a const byte array. total_bombs_used is
the bomb TU's first variable; the following speed table is word-aligned,
so -a2 starts before bomb_reimu_c().
---
 th02/gaiji/loadfree.cpp       |  5 +--
 th02/main/hud/hud.cpp         | 65 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 th02/main/player/bombanim.cpp |  5 +++
 th02/main/score.cpp           |  1 -
 th02/main/score.hpp           |  2 +-
 th02_main.asm                 | 37 --------------------
 6 files changed, 56 insertions(+), 59 deletions(-)

diff --git a/th02/gaiji/loadfree.cpp b/th02/gaiji/loadfree.cpp
index d62c418d..aca57e19 100644
--- a/th02/gaiji/loadfree.cpp
+++ b/th02/gaiji/loadfree.cpp
@@ -3,11 +3,8 @@
 
 void near gaiji_load(void)
 {
-	#undef GAIJI_FN
-	extern const char GAIJI_FN[];
-
 	gaiji_backup();
-	gaiji_entry_bfnt(GAIJI_FN);
+	gaiji_entry_bfnt(SHIFTJIS_FN);
 }
 
 void near gaiji_free(void)
diff --git a/th02/main/hud/hud.cpp b/th02/main/hud/hud.cpp
index c693393c..0e6022a2 100644
--- a/th02/main/hud/hud.cpp
+++ b/th02/main/hud/hud.cpp
@@ -12,21 +12,34 @@
